Hello Alsa and Qt users

QasMixer version 0.9.0 is now available.
This version fixes some issues with different desktop themes
and brings new scaling check button widgets.

New features

* New scaling check button widget for the sliders pad
* New notification balloon timeout option

Visible changes

* Fix for the widget spacing in the switches area on some desktop themes
* Use of QCheckBoxes instead of custom check box widgets -
  better desktop theme compatibility
* Reduced manual styling that may interfere with desktop themes
* Playback/Capture sliders labels colors are back
* Overhauled settings dialog
* Application icon tweaks
* Layout tweaks

Core changes

* Optimizations and fixes


Homepage with more informations and screenshots
http://xwmw.org/qasmixer

Files are hosted at sourceforge
http://sourceforge.net/projects/qasmixer/


Happy volume changing!

